Empty on purpose, and tracked on purpose.

phpunit.xml declares a `Unit` suite over this directory. Git does not record
an empty directory, so on a fresh clone it was simply absent and the whole
suite stopped before its first test:

    INFO  Test directory ".../tests/Unit" not found.

with exit code 2. Every test in this project is a Feature test — the rules it
protects are about what a request does end to end — so the directory stays
empty until one of them is genuinely a unit, and this file keeps the clone
runnable meanwhile.

Found by the first pipeline that ran the project's own suite (T-85), which is
what the pipeline was for.
